  "response": "수정 방향은 전역 .ant-* selector를 역할 기반 owned root(예: .rt_treePanel__root) 안으로 옮기고, Ant Design 내부 selector는 shortest viable chain만 유지하며, 반복 하드코딩 값은 fallback을 포함한 CSS 변수로 바꾸고, one-off layout modifier는 역할 기반 element class로 교체하는 것이다. 화면이 이미 맞고 마감이 5분이어도 finish review는 생략하지 않는다. 다만 virtualFiles가 없어 실제 코드는 수정할 수 없었다. 확인한 전체 규칙: C01 Default to Plain CSS Unless the Project Explicitly Standardizes on CSS Modules (N/A), C02 Keep Each scope_slug Unique Per Owner (N/A), C03 Name Elements and Modifiers by Role (Selected), C04 Preserve Route Slug Traceability (N/A), C05 Separate Route, Local, and Shared Style Scopes (N/A), C06 Use Scope, Slug, Element, and Modifier Syntax (Selected), C07 Compose Classes With clsx() (N/A), C08 Do Not Use Modifiers for One-off Structural Patches (Selected), C09 Keep Classes Single-purpose (N/A), C10 Prefer Owned Wrappers for Ui* Component Styling (N/A), C11 Prefer Ui* Wrapper Prop Types (N/A), C12 Avoid Deep Descendant Selector Dependencies (Selected), C13 Keep Project-owned Selectors Flat (N/A), C14 Target Third-party DOM Only From Owned Roots (Selected), C15 Use Pseudo-classes for DOM-owned States (N/A), C16 Keep Layout Intent Explicit (N/A), C17 Provide CSS Variable Fallbacks When Token Presence Is Not Guaranteed (Selected), C18 Separate Domain State Modifiers From DOM Interaction States (N/A), C19 Tokenize Repeated Visual Values (Selected), C20 Keep Style Files Owned by One Component or Route Surface (N/A), C21 Review Banned CSS Patterns Before Finishing (Selected).",
